references disagree with the merged behaviour on something outside these three fields, I will report it rather than widen the head.\n\nExact clean pushed head, per-path artifacts, docset and the relevant gates green with -count=1, and independent review at the exact head before merge — codex is the natural reviewer, having found the gap."}